  "en": "<html lang=\"en\"><head><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/en/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh-CN\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/zh-CN/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/en/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/ko/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/en/site.webmanifest\"><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/en/\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"name\":\"とらんすナビ\",\"d\":\"A free voice training tool for anyone working toward a feminine or masculine voice: people who want both, transgender people, and anyone curious about a voice they do not have yet. Pick a reference voice, record while imitating it, and see your own voice in the same acoustic space, with the distance to the voice you are aiming for. Real-time measurement included.\"}</script></head><body><a href=\"/en/\">How to use</a><p>The link carries only the five measurements; the recording is not sent. <a href=\"/method.html\" target=\"_blank\" hreflang=\"ja\">Method and sources</a> (Japanese) explains how to read the verdict.</p><p title=\"The link carries only the five measurements; the recording is not sent. &lt;a href=&quot;/method.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; hreflang=&quot;ja&quot;&gt;Method and sources&lt;/a&gt; (Japanese) explains how to read the verdict.\"></p><span title=\"Close\">Close</span></body></html>",
  "ja": "<html lang=\"ja\"><head><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh-CN\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/zh-CN/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/en/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/ko/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\"><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ja_JP\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"name\":\"とらんすナビ\",\"d\":\"両声類を目指す方、トランスジェンダーの方、女声・男声を出してみたい方向けの無料ボイトレツール。見本の声を真似して録音すると、自分の声が見本と同じ分布図に表示され、近づきたい声との距離が見えます。リアルタイム測定にも対応。\"}</script></head><body><a href=\"/\">使い方</a><p>リンクには5つの測定値だけが含まれます。録音は送信されません。判定の読み方は<a href=\"/method.html\" target=\"_blank\">測定方法と出典</a>にあります。</p><p title=\"リンクには5つの測定値だけが含まれます。録音は送信されません。判定の読み方は&lt;a href=&quot;/method.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;測定方法と出典&lt;/a&gt;にあります。\"></p><span title=\"閉じる\">閉じる</span></body></html>",
  "ko": "<html lang=\"ko\"><head><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/ko/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh-CN\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/zh-CN/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/en/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/ko/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/ko/site.webmanifest\"><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://koe.transnavi.jp/ko/\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"name\":\"とらんすナビ\",\"d\":\"여성 목소리나 남성 목소리를 익히고 싶은 사람, 트랜스젠더, 아직 없는 목소리를 한번 내 보고 싶은 사람을 위한 무료 목소리 훈련 도구입니다. 참고 음성을 골라 따라 하며 녹음하면 내 목소리가 같은 음향 공간에 나타나고, 목표로 하는 목소리까지의 거리가 보입니다. 실시간 측정도 됩니다.\"}</script></head><body><a href=\"/ko/\">사용법</a><p>링크에는 다섯 측정값만 들어 있고, 녹음은 보내지 않습니다. 판정 읽는 법은 <a href=\"/method.html\" target=\"_blank\" hreflang=\"ja\">측정 방법과 출처</a>(일본어)에 있습니다.</p><p title=\"링크에는 다섯 측정값만 들어 있고, 녹음은 보내지 않습니다. 판정 읽는 법은 &lt;a href=&quot;/method.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; hreflang=&quot;ja&quot;&gt;측정 방법과 출처&lt;/a&gt;(일본어)에 있습니다.\"></p><span title=\"닫기\">닫기</span></body></html>",
